== Usage ==
*<pvxbig> Stay in Spear set between fights, switch to Daggers as you are about to spike
* Prebuff yourself with {{skill pvxicon|Nightmare Weapon|12}}
* Use {{skill pvxicon|Renewing Surge|12}} → {{skill pvxicon|Black Spider Strike|3}} → {{skill pvxicon|Vampiric Assault|16}} → {{skill pvxicon|Impale|16}} → {{skill pvxicon|Signet of Toxic Shock|16}} for the spike.
** Use Signet of Toxic Shock right after Black Spider Strike/Vampiric Assault when fearing condition removal or lacking energy. 
* Close distance with {{skill pvxicon|Wastrel's Collapse}}. Use it after enemy finishes an ability for guaranteed knockdown
* Use {{skill pvxicon|Mark of Instability}} before {{skill pvxicon|Wastrel's Collapse}} for quarter knocking. 
* Between spikes, use {{skill pvxicon|Nightmare Weapon|12}} + Spear autoattack for small poke damage and sustain.
* Use {{skill pvxicon|Nightmare Weapon|12}} + longbow for slow but safe lifesteal against stationary NPCs or when at high-ground advantage.</pvxbig>
* Dash to move around and get out of sticky scenarios.

== Counters ==
* Anti-melee early in the combo
* Well-timed condition and hex removal
* Interrupting Impale/SoTS

== Variants ==
*<pvxbig> {{skill pvxicon|Shadow Prison|16}} over {{skill pvxicon|Wastrel's Collapse}} against heavy hex removal. Be aware of the higher energy cost.</pvxbig>